<view class="page"><view class="title">下一竿，去哪里？</view><view class="sub">天气、15天预报与鱼种指数共用所选地点。</view><view class="label">钓鱼水域</view><picker range="{{habitats}}" value="{{habitatIndex}}" bindchange="habitat"><view class="picker">{{habitats[habitatIndex]}} ⌄</view></picker><view class="label">省级地区</view><picker range="{{provinces}}" value="{{provinceIndex}}" bindchange="province"><view class="picker">{{provinces[provinceIndex]}} ⌄</view></picker><input class="input" value="{{query}}" data-field="query" bindinput="input" placeholder="例如：杭州、三亚、尤溪" maxlength="60" confirm-type="search" bindconfirm="search"/><button class="primary" bindtap="search">搜索全国地点</button><view class="sub">{{status}}</view><button wx:for="{{results}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="choose" data-index="{{index}}"><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="sub">{{item.caption}}</view></button><button bindtap="locate">使用手机定位</button><view class="card"><view>地名未收录？填写WGS84坐标</view><input class="input" value="{{name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="input" placeholder="地点名称" maxlength="60"/><input class="input" value="{{lat}}" data-field="lat" bindinput="input" placeholder="纬度，如30.2741"/><input class="input" value="{{lng}}" data-field="lng" bindinput="input" placeholder="经度，如120.1551"/><button bindtap="coordinate">使用此坐标</button></view><view class="sub">地点索引：GeoNames / Open-Meteo。搜索词发送给地名服务，所选坐标用于预报。最近地点保存在本机；勿直接使用高德、百度的偏移坐标。</view></view><privacy-dialog/>
